WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.867
Hello! Welcome to our St. Patrick's Day parade!

2
00:00:04.868 --> 00:00:07.803
We have lots of fun on St. Patrick's Day.

3
00:00:07.804 --> 00:00:12.799
Do you know what St. Patrick's Day is?

4
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.085
St. Patrick was born in Britain.

5
00:00:15.086 --> 00:00:17.115
His family was very rich.

6
00:00:17.116 --> 00:00:25.286
When St. Patrick was 16 years old, something terrible happened.

7
00:00:25.287 --> 00:00:28.555
A group of pirates attacked St. Patrick's home.

8
00:00:28.556 --> 00:00:32.476
Then they kidnapped the young man and took him to Ireland.

9
00:00:32.477 --> 00:00:39.177
The pirates sold St. Patrick as a slave.

10
00:00:39.178 --> 00:00:42.635
St. Patrick spent six years as a slave.

11
00:00:42.636 --> 00:00:44.292
He worked as a shepherd.

12
00:00:44.293 --> 00:00:52.494
Being far away from his family made St. Patrick feel sad and lonely.

13
00:00:52.495 --> 00:00:55.261
But St. Patrick prayed every day.

14
00:00:55.262 --> 00:00:58.131
His faith grew stronger and stronger.

15
00:00:58.132 --> 00:01:03.301
One day, St. Patrick heard a voice telling him to run away.

16
00:01:03.302 --> 00:01:05.880
So St. Patrick listened to the voice.

17
00:01:05.881 --> 00:01:08.280
He escaped and went to France.

18
00:01:08.281 --> 00:01:15.282
In France, St. Patrick became a priest.

19
00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:20.034
When St. Patrick was about sixty years old, he returned to Ireland.

20
00:01:20.035 --> 00:01:23.103
He wanted to tell the Irish about his faith.

21
00:01:23.104 --> 00:01:28.417
Almost everybody loved Patrick.

22
00:01:28.418 --> 00:01:30.723
He carried a shamrock with him.

23
00:01:30.724 --> 00:01:33.365
A shamrock is a three-leaf clover.

24
00:01:33.366 --> 00:01:40.707
St. Patrick used a shamrock to teach people about God.

25
00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:45.625
According to legend, St. Patrick drove out all the snakes in Ireland.

26
00:01:45.626 --> 00:01:47.907
Snakes were a symbol of evil.

27
00:01:47.908 --> 00:01:54.061
St. Patrick wanted to remove all evil from Ireland.

28
00:01:54.062 --> 00:01:58.709
When St. Patrick died, the people of Ireland were very sad.

29
00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:01.020
They decided to honor his death.

30
00:02:01.021 --> 00:02:08.840
That's how St. Patrick's Day began.

31
00:02:08.841 --> 00:02:11.833
Can you guess why we are all wearing green?

32
00:02:11.834 --> 00:02:14.219
Green is the color of spring!

33
00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:25.440
Since St. Patrick died in the spring, we wear green to show that we honor him.

34
00:02:25.441 --> 00:02:29.334
A four-leaf clover, that's a sign of good luck!

35
00:02:29.335 --> 00:02:35.454
On St. Patrick's Day, it is good luck to find a four-leaf clover.

36
00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:38.622
As for me, I'm a leprechaun.

37
00:02:38.623 --> 00:02:42.623
I am part of St. Patrick's Day because I am Irish too!

38
00:02:42.624 --> 00:02:52.828
Now that you know about St. Patrick's Day, why don't you join our fun?

